      "id": "claim_fdb00c4d630a4a55a0e182c11a2f4406",
      "statement": "`agents/feishu/index.ts` 的 `onRequest` 在任何正常消息处理之前先按 `url.searchParams.get(\"probe\")` 分流到七个自测端点（start / check / env / model / last / search / store），每个端点只隔离一层失败面。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agents/feishu/index.ts#L54-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7bd66b2ffbab0c64b7670d605e508731ed6ba69ed73308b3a452ff65c6b1b1c8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6ccb6c65fd4e48ba9f870c13015713e4",
      "statement": "所有探针的门禁收口在单个 `tokenGate(context, url)` 函数（`?token=<INTERNAL_TOKEN>` 相等才放行，否则 401）；这是评审修正的结果，因为逐个调用点手抄门禁曾导致 `probe=env` 漏掉令牌校验且线上无令牌也能拿到 200。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agents/feishu/index.ts#L281-L306",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:058645194531e26f3462216cd090a4677065fce662749fe7fea3ab0c006e7032:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c6b31d35362343e38a5e03ebab0c50cf",
      "statement": "探针门禁的设计规则是「按这个端点会不会泄漏东西开，不按谁在用开」；唯一的公开例外是 `probe=start` / `probe=check`，因为它们只读写自己会话的 `probe.bg` 键、泄漏面为零，而状态页要在浏览器里直接调用它们，把 INTERNAL_TOKEN 塞进公开静态页等于公开它。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://agents/feishu/index.ts#L283-L306",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fc752a449190f58378ecc16e735f99c1750d227f75bab137582eb85686456cc7:"
